{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ん〜〜〜〜〜！ななせまる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/nanase.nishino/img/2014/05/09/1925586/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分との戦い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勝つときも負けるときもある〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張る！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シアターガイド"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"にて若月、いこまちゃん、福田監督と対談をしました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"監督の話を聞いたら気持ちが少し軽くなりました！ぜひチェックしてみてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと最近、ヨシヒコを1から見直しまして、夜にひとりでよく笑いました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり好き！面白い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"稽古がんばろ〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっとマイバースデーは稽古日だぁなぁ( ；´Д｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5/5横浜個別握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございましたm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついこないだもこの同じ場所に来たー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次は名古屋かなぁ、楽しみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！生誕祭があるみたいなのでどんな服を着ようかなって考えとります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいかとらりんも一緒かな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年のプリンシパルの時に3人合同で生誕祭をしてもらえてすごくいい思い出です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"赤がれいか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白がなな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"黄色がらりん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チューリップや((o(｡>ω<｡)o))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3人とも20歳やし、嬉しいなぁ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会でも先におめでとうって言っとくねって、たくさん。ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/nanase.nishino/img/2014/05/09/1925586/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"擬似ボブ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/nanase.nishino/img/2014/05/09/1925586/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツイン！右見て左見て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リボンを結んでもらってみた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり鎖骨くらいまで髪の毛切りたいな〜。切っていいのなら自分の手でハサミを持って、バシッと切りたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっそうだモンハン10周年記念のお祝いメッセージ色紙を描かせていただきました(^ー゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絵も描いた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今後どこかで見れるはずなのでぜひ見てください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/nanase.nishino/img/2014/05/09/1925586/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"五月"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気づいたら5/25って書いてた...この女の子は私ではありませんがガラスのハートを持ってもらいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも安全第一の帽子を被ってる子です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問に答える"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⚫︎私、青い固形燃料が燃えた匂い結構好きなんだけど、なぁちゃんは好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その匂いがわからない！ぜひ匂ってみたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⚫︎いんげんの胡麻和えの魅力教えて⁇正直あんまり好きじゃない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず茹でただけのいんげんが好きで、そして胡麻も好きなので、その2つが合わさると最強なんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ作って差し上げたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⚫︎なぁちゃんは飼うならカメレオンと毒蛇どっちがいい？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カメレオン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⚫︎ななせまるは自撮りの写真をブログなどにUPした後、残してますか？(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"消すときもあるし残すときもあるので、どちらとも言えないぃ(⌒-⌒; )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⚫︎二十歳の誕生日に、神様からプレゼントが貰えるとしたら、七瀬さんなら何を貰いますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"透明人間になれるシステム！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"林野庁のお仕事行ってきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本の木を使うことはすごくいいこと。だから将来は木の家を建てたいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体にも良いし、ななは檜の香りが好き〜((o(｡>ω<｡)o))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木どこのキャンプが懐かしい、また森に行きたいなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"虫は嫌ではあるが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リフレッシュしたいというか一回全身をスッキリとしたい田舎で一ヶ月暮らしたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/nanase.nishino/img/nanase.nishino/img/2014/05/09/1925586/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斉藤優里！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいっっっ"}],"source":"archive"}